sase-e8[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Excellent @commit: argument completion in the prompt bar and LSP[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing `@commit:` offers the project's recent revisions across [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]every one of its repos — in the ACE prompt bar and in any LSP [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]editor — ranked by relevance then recency, rendered as a short SHA [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]plus the commit subject, and every row it offers resolves at [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]launch.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]commit_ref_completion.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/commit_ref_completion.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scoped payload rows and stable payload ranking[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core_menu[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_menu: add `scope`, `rank`, and `body` to the at-reference payload [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row wire, match a qualified `scope@title` target so a repo fragment and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subject words combine in one query, and make provider rank the tiebreak [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after tier and score so recency survives a typed query.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Local commit enumeration in the shared payload inventory[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core_commits[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_menu[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_commits: enumerate each repository checkout's recent revisions with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a bounded, timed `git log`, emit rows keyed by a 12-char-floored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]abbreviated SHA merged across repos in recency order, and drop the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`commit` early-out that made the kind unenumerable.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python binding for the payload inventory[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core_bridge[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_commits[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_bridge: expose `artifact_ref_payload_inventory(kind, context)` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through `sase_core_rs`, release the sase-core version that carries it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and widen the `sase-core-rs` dependency window so the host can consume [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Commit-aware LSP completion items[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]lsp_items[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_commits[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lsp_items: describe payload items by their artifact kind instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]always \"file\", mark identifier-backed kinds as references, and render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the commit body into item documentation.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pane-independent commit snapshots in the prompt bar[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui_commits[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_bridge[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui_commits: replace the mounted-Commits-pane projection with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TTL-revalidated background snapshot from the shared inventory, show a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loading row while the first snapshot lands, and render commit rows with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a dimmed repo segment and no duplicated detail.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and end-to-end verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs_verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lsp_items, tui_commits[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs_verify: correct the editor and getting-started documentation that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]still says commit references are not enumerated, and verify the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion-resolution invariant end to end in both surfaces.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e8","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-e8.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4bde4f114a69cd8ccac252ea8eb55d7e","started_at":"2026-08-02T10:07:28.523506","state":"dismissed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":"2026-08-02T11:08:19.198102","files":{"chat":{"digest":"8e04e033f7e2a58da13ca105b2476ac6624a187051fae7b1fcc426f32ac33d71","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e8.3/chat.md","size_bytes":13043},"commits":{"digest":"7efd068b1d20566bb0f0673a091aaf50d67dc09cf2098fb3f31b2e1d3fdaf882","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e8.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e8.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"b43e133ebc684fc66b7d37b39dfd59919362f262ae5efa6dddcc7fe9889d0256","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e8.3/meta.json","size_bytes":631},"prompt":{"digest":"3aec568593af3b5c14fe5756bb101e8205b3b602a40cdfb12de05ce364af8aa0",